  "revision_title": "毛选：读懂《实践论》，别只记住吃梨子",
  "revision_sha256": "b67025b1163e3442b9e4bb6e18317622a855dbb4f52eb8ad6feb1c48974a3ea1",
  "draft_media_id": "YNxOnkeDOZzJhARCaZWR-f6bGzmA3IrDGgXHjKL4vbxbhq0ye31X4HqHRQQR9tW_",
